msgid "The SmokePing templates failed to import. See the health table."
msgstr "SmokePing 範本匯入失敗。請參閱健康狀態資料表。"

#: smokeping_import.php
msgid "Your device permissions do not cover every device, so you cannot import a SmokePing configuration. Ask an administrator with access to all devices."
msgstr "您的裝置權限未涵蓋所有裝置，因此無法匯入 SmokePing 設定。請洽詢具有所有裝置存取權限的管理員。"

#: smokeping_import.php
msgid "Name the new graph tree, or choose an existing tree or no tree."
msgstr "請為新圖樹命名，或選擇現有圖樹或不選擇圖樹。"

#: smokeping_import.php
msgid "The uploaded file is larger than 4 MiB."
msgstr "上傳的檔案大於 4 MiB。"

#: smokeping_import.php
#, php-format
msgid "The SmokePing configuration cannot be read, so nothing was imported: %s"
msgstr "無法讀取 SmokePing 設定，因此未匯入任何項目：%s"

#: smokeping_import.php
msgid "There is no previewed import to apply. Preview it again."
msgstr "沒有已預覽的匯入項目可套用。請重新預覽。"

#: smokeping_import.php
#, php-format
msgid "and %d more; see the Cacti log"
msgstr "還有另外 %d 筆；請參閱 Cacti 日誌"

#: smokeping_import.php
msgid "The SmokePing configuration was imported."
msgstr "已匯入 SmokePing 設定。"

